<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Yeyen Crypto</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🚀 Yeyen Crypto</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#tentang">Tentang</a>
      <a href="#tokenomics">Tokenomics</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section id="tentang">
    <h2>Tentang Proyek</h2>
    <p>Yeyen Crypto adalah proyek token komunitas yang fokus pada edukasi, farming, dan inovasi blockchain.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="tokenomics">
    <h2>Tokenomics</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Supply Total: 1,000,000 YYN</li>
      <li>Distribusi: 40% komunitas, 30% airdrop, 20% tim, 10% cadangan</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="roadmap">
    <h2>Roadmap</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Q4 2026: Launch token & website</li>
      <li>Q1 2027: Listing di DEX</li>
      <li>Q2 2027: Integrasi DeFi & NFT</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="kontak">
    <h2>Hubungi Kami</h2>
    <form>
      <input type="text" placeholder="Nama">
      <input type="email" placeholder="Email">
      <textarea placeholder="Pesan"></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Kirim</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Yeyen Crypto</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  background: #0d0d0d;
  color: #f0f0f0;
}
header {
  background: #1a1a1a;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}
nav a {
  margin: 0 10px;
  color: #00ffcc;
  text-decoration: none;
}
section {
  padding: 40px;
}
footer {
  background: #1a1a1a;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 10px;
}
button {
  background: #00ffcc;
  border: none;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
